<title>CHINA: Shanghai April GDP up 15.6 percent year-on-year.</title>
<headline>Shanghai April GDP up 15.6 percent year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai's gross domestic product (GDP) was 26.582 billion yuan in April 1997, up 15.6 percent from April 1996, Shanghai's Business News said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The city's GDP for the first four months of 1997 was 95.219 billion yuan, a rise of 14.1 percent compared with the same period last year, the newspaper said.</p>
